{
  "$comment": "Gzipped size ceilings for each published entry point's FESM bundle, plus the entry-point import layering that must hold in the built artifact. Raising a ceiling is a deliberate, reviewable diff — do not bump one to make CI pass without saying why in the PR body. `forbiddenImports` encodes the AGENTS.md entry-point graph: core must never reach a companion, and locale must stay the leaf.",
